## 12. Migrating an existing C++ ticket-work repo to the new level names

1. Rename content: move old `senior-level/` themes → new `entry-level/`.
2. Retire or archive old entry/junior notebooks (or keep in `legacy/` if user wants history).
3. Author **new** Mid + Staff tickets (10 new defects + tests).
4. Update ticket ID prefixes and crosswalk.
5. Re-run full test matrix (buggy FAIL, fixed PASS).

